<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Independent research archive · 2000—present</p><h1>Artists, ideas,<br><em>and our time.</em></h1><p class="intro">An evolving visual archive of contemporary artists, works, moving images and critical perspectives.</p></section><section id="artists"><p class="eyebrow">The collection</p><h2>Artist directory <small id="count"></small></h2><div class="controls"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search artists, media, themes…" aria-label="Search artists"><select id="filter" aria-label="Filter collection"><option value="all">All collections</option><option value="contemporary">Contemporary Art</option><option value="experimental">Photography / Motion / Experimental</option></select></div><div class="grid" id="grid">{% for artist in artists %}<a class="card artist-card" href="{{ ('/artists/' + artist.slug + '/') | url }}" data-category="{{ artist.category }}" data-search="{{ (artist.name + ' ' + artist.media + ' ' + artist.summary) | lower }}"><div class="atlas-media">{% if artist.images.length %}<img loading="lazy" src="{{ artist.images[0].src }}" alt="{{ artist.images[0].alt }}" onerror="this.hidden=true;this.nextElementSibling.hidden=false"><div class="media-placeholder" hidden><span>{{ artist.name }}</span><small>Image temporarily unavailable</small></div>{% else %}<div class="media-placeholder" aria-label="Artwork image pending"><span>{{ artist.name }}</span><small>Visual documentation pending</small></div>{% endif %}</div><span class="tag">{{ 'Photography / Motion / Experimental' if artist.category == 'experimental' else 'Contemporary Art' }}</span><h3>{{ artist.name }}</h3><p>{{ artist.media }}</p><p>{{ artist.summary }}</p><span class="profile-link">Explore profile →</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section><section id="about"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h2>Research and attribution</h2><p class="intro">Profiles distinguish verified media from research leads. We prioritize original sources, attribution, rights records and Chicago/APA bibliographies. Missing images are not replaced with unrelated pictures.</p></section><script src="{{ '/assets/directory.js' | url }}" defer></script>
